WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
Canada company formation, a quick starting point.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:08.440
A corporation can be incorporated federally or through a province or territory.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:12.820
You may also need a federal business number, a corporation income tax account,

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:16.660
registrations where you do business, and permits for your activity.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.640
Requirements depend on the jurisdiction and your business.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.880
Check the Government of Canada guidance before applying.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.260
FoundStart does not currently offer Canada formation,

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.840
and no confirmed Canada partner is listed here.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.480
Use the Canada information page to learn more.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.200
This video is general information, not legal or tax advice.
